In sincere and uninterrupted internatl collaboration to settle
                            disputes by peaceful means, to raise standards of living everywhere, and
                            to combat injustice, intolerance, poverty and fear;

To put an end to aggression and subversion and to the betrayal of
                            nationalist independence movements in the interest of a new
                            imperialism;

For a free world dedicated to the observance of human rights, to the
                            removal of barriers to friendly intercourse among peoples, and to the
                            free communication of ideas;
